Create website with DevOps Tools

Step 1: 1:- Go to any cloud provider GCP/AWS/Azure/etc
Step 2 :- Create Virtual machine
Step 3:- install docker

        sudo -i
        apt-get update
        apt install docker.io
        docker -v

Step 4:- Download website from https://www.tooplate.com/free-templates 

change url in place of download's use zip-templates & .zip
        wget https://www.tooplate.com/zip-templates/2142_cloud_sync.zip 
        https://www.tooplate.com/zip-templates/2140_stellaris_research.zip

        wget https://www.tooplate.com/zip-templates/2153_fireworks_composer.zip
        
        wget
        apt install unzip

Step 5:- Run the nginx container with downloaded website
        docker run -ti-d -p 80:80 -v /root/technology:/usr/share/nginx/htil nginx
Step 6 :- Go to IP address:80 and verify
